{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-easee-one-ev-charger-backplate-bp-ap-1-slash-s01-01-2604-0019","content_id":"fbc3db37-ab13-4ac6-a87a-d35c73ddc75f","description":"Product Safety Report for Easee One EV Charger Backplate BP-AP-1/s01-01. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"cd751f41-ea55-4852-89c1-b9eb360a1acd","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-06T12:22:06+01:00","id":"cd751f41-ea55-4852-89c1-b9eb360a1acd","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-06T12:22:06+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69fb245e8b482f931a43f50c/2604-0019-product-safety-report-easee-EV-charger-backplate.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Easee One EV Charger Backplate BP-AP-1/s01-01</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: A small quantity of backplates were fitted with incorrect labelling.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: Modification programme.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Electric Vehicle Supply Equipment (EVSE)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td> Easee </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>BP-AP-1/s01-01</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Norway</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>The Easee One Backplate (BP-AP-1/s01-01) is a wall-mounted wiring base for the Easee One EV charger. It provides the electrical termination interface where the supply cables are connected. Affected units were placed on the UK market during a limited period between late September 2025 and 3 February 2026.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_cd751f41-ea55-4852-89c1-b9eb360a1acd\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69fb245e8b482f931a43f50c/2604-0019-product-safety-report-easee-EV-charger-backplate.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The affected units have been fitted with an incorrect three‑phase terminal label. Specifically, the terminal that should be clearly marked as “PME” (Protective Multiple Earthing) is incorrectly labelled as “L3”, which may mislead installers during installation. This incorrect labelling could cause an electrician to connect the PME conductor to the standard PE terminal instead of the dedicated PME terminal, potentially bypassing the charger’s built‑in PEN fault detection and automatic disconnection function required for UK PME installations.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Modification programme. </p>\n\n<p>Easee have identified affected products using serial number traceability and installer records. Where a mislabelled unit is confirmed to be incorrectly wired and without external PEN protection, charging is temporarily paused until remediation is completed. Where required, corrective actions include inspection, replacement of the backplate and verification by a qualified electrician.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0019</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-06T11:25:59Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-06","product_risk_level":"low"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-06T12:25:59+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-easee-one-ev-charger-backplate-bp-ap-1-slash-s01-01-2604-0019","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-easee-one-ev-charger-backplate-bp-ap-1-slash-s01-01-2604-0019","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-easee-one-ev-charger-backplate-bp-ap-1-slash-s01-01-2604-0019","content_id":"fbc3db37-ab13-4ac6-a87a-d35c73ddc75f","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-06T11:25:59Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Easee One EV Charger Backplate BP-AP-1/s01-01 (2604-0019)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-easee-one-ev-charger-backplate-bp-ap-1-slash-s01-01-2604-0019","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","